WEBVTT

00:11:31.162 --> 00:11:34.037
Abed then showed me a picture
of his mashed truck,

00:11:34.037 --> 00:11:36.537
and said that the crash
was the fault of a bus driver

00:11:36.579 --> 00:11:38.871
in the left lane who did not let him pass.

00:11:39.496 --> 00:11:42.412
I did not want to recap
the crash with Abed.

00:11:42.412 --> 00:11:44.121
I'd hoped for something simpler:

00:11:44.121 --> 00:11:47.954
to exchange a Turkish dessert
for two words and be on my way.

00:11:48.871 --> 00:11:51.621
And so I didn't point out
that in his own testimony

00:11:51.662 --> 00:11:53.746
the morning after the crash,

00:11:53.746 --> 00:11:55.912
Abed did not even mention the bus driver.

00:11:55.912 --> 00:11:57.246
No, I was quiet.

00:11:57.287 --> 00:11:59.537
I was quiet because I had not
come for truth.

00:11:59.537 --> 00:12:01.371
I had come for remorse.